    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span><span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Two pointers</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/valid-palindrome/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 125</a></div>\n  <h1>Valid Palindrome</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: walk one pointer in from each end, skip anything that is not a letter or digit, and compare the rest case-insensitively; the first mismatch answers \"no\". O(n) time, O(1) space, no cleaned copy.</p>\n"
